{"id":"zadolgo","lemma":"задолго","pos":"adv","rank":3407,"glosses":["long before, well in advance"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a8/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это случилось задолго до твоего рождения.","en":"That happened long before you were born.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"},null,{"g":"until / before"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"birth","l":"рождение"}]},{"text":"Я влюбился в Мэри задолго до того, как она вообще узнала, кто я такой.","en":"I fell in love with Mary long before she even knew who I was.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to fall in love","l":"влюбиться"},{"g":"in"},null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"generally"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"узнать"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"like that, like this"}],"phrases":[[5,8,"before, till"]]}]}